id: fizzbuzz
category: basics
difficulty: 2
libs:
checker: exact
timeout: 10
--- prompt
Write an Objeck program that prints the numbers from 1 to 15, one per line. For multiples of 3 print Fizz instead of the number, for multiples of 5 print Buzz, and for multiples of both print FizzBuzz.
--- expected
1
2
Fizz
4
Buzz
Fizz
7
8
Fizz
Buzz
11
Fizz
13
14
FizzBuzz
--- reference
class FizzBuzz {
	function : Main(args : String[]) ~ Nil {
		for(i := 1; i <= 15; i += 1;) {
			if(i % 15 = 0) {
				"FizzBuzz"->PrintLine();
			}
			else if(i % 3 = 0) {
				"Fizz"->PrintLine();
			}
			else if(i % 5 = 0) {
				"Buzz"->PrintLine();
			}
			else {
				i->PrintLine();
			};
		};
	}
}
